                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very entertaining, keeps a person busy for hours, once started you keep playing because you want to finish the damn hard level. There's an immense amount diversity of gamemodes, well immense is exagerated since there are only 4 different ones but each level is different on its own and becomes more challenging the further you get. After some time the levels are all just hard but the difference between them is what makes it even more challenging.\nIn the end I would recommend this game to everyone. The thing is most of my friends are poor AF and can't afford to buy this beauty...",
